[Notes.AbstrInv_Disclaimer DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Kill Chain"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Eliminate an increasing number of enemies with less than 4 seconds between each kill.\n \nThe countdown timer only starts after the first enemy has been killed. Take your time to set up your actions.\n\nExperiment with your supernatural powers and gadgets. Bend Time specifically is your best ally.\nIt's also possible to use your environment creatively. \nDon't forget to rewire the security systems if you intend to use them to your advantage.\n \nScoring:  \n* Each kill gives you points.\n* The less time between the kills, the more points you score.\n* Kill enemies in different ways to score more points. \n \nSpecial: \nEach time a round is completed, you have the possibility to play a bonus round with a unique objective. Don't mess up this one, you can't restart it if you fail. \n \nGame Over: \nThere is no game over. If you fail a round, you just restart it."

[Notes.AbstrInv_Phase01_Chain_Disclaimer DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Round 01 - Chain Bonus"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Kill 3 characters in 1 second without using Bend Time."

[Notes.AbstrInv_Phase01_Env_Disclaimer DisAbstractItem]
